            $TRANS$Creating Organizational Data-Based Bots Assistant is a bot generator that enables the creation and customization of bots according to the user's needs and on the basis of organizational data. Creating bots1. Pressing the New Bot button. 2. Fill in the fields: The name of the bot – a required field Description of the bot and the definition of its target audience – the content filled in in these fields will be transferred to the prompt that creates a character for the bot (for example: the wording and knowledge of an electrical engineer in Ormat). You can proceed to creating the bot even without filling out these fields, and the character prompt can be filled out later manually (detailed below). 3. Click on the Create button.$TRANS$
