            $TRANS$We will leave all the default properties under Advance Options as they are. 5. Click on the Submit button. While the document is uploaded, a panel will appear on the bottom left where we can see the status of the document's upload. When the document is uploaded, we will see it along with all the other documents in the Data tab. Uploading a file via Data is preferable to uploading a file via Chat Attachments since the file is saved in the system and there is no need to re-upload it, which saves time and costs.$TRANS$
