            $TRANS$Cluade 3 Haiku Prompts Managing and creating custom prompts The Prompts tab allows you to manage and create predefined prompts, for example – a prompt for creating a presentation, a prompt for translating an email into a foreign language, a document summary, and more. Allows you to delete the prompt Allows you to create a new prompt Allows you to view or edit the prompt Create and manage a prompt You can create prompts by clicking the New button. To view or edit an existing prompt we will highlight it and click on the Edit button (on the bottom right).$TRANS$
