            '2026-04-12T08:15:52.511000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Hi Nir! It's great that you've agreed to be part of the Buddy program Jeen.ai the company's only and best 😊 program under the program, every new employee gets a Buddy that accompanies them during the first period and helps them integrate seamlessly into the team and the company. The duration of the program is two weeks, during which time you serve as an initial point of contact for the new employee. Details about the new employee: New employee's name: Almog Moyal Phone: 0503036061 Start date: 05/4/26 Team: Solution A little about Almog: A final year student in industry and management at Afeka.$TRANS$
