            '2026-04-12T08:15:52.513000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Small tips, there is no such thing as a small question, sometimes the most helpful things are actually the informal things, if you don't know something - you can always refer someone else, sometimes a short conversation in the hallway or in Slack makes all the difference, thank you very much for your willingness to take part in the program! This is one of the things that makes our culture in Jeen.ai what it is.$TRANS$
