            '2026-04-12T08:15:52.513000+00:00',
            $TRANS$Explain how things work on a day-to-day basis in society. Help get to know relevant people in your team or organization. The second week in the second week can be a little less tight, but still stay available and check in from time to time how things are going. Check once every few days how it is going and if there are any questions. Make sure the new employee feels comfortable reaching out to you if necessary. To help if necessary in getting to know other people or processes in the organization.$TRANS$
        );
